[{"title":"寒食前一日拟移尊于南山寺僧舍延宗振小酌代柬二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"积雨逢新霁，移尊伴胜幽。\n兰亭觞已后，莲社会初投。\n啼鸟当窗巧，飞云傍槛浮。\n酒阑应得句，更为暝钟留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19519,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潇湘八景 其一 山市晴岚","author":"卢龙云","text":"洞远飞晴翠，峰高近蔚蓝。\n雨馀山树秀，烟净野花酣。\n市肆帘初捲，溪桥路可探。\n垆头堪竟日，有客漫停骖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19520,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潇湘八景 其二 烟寺晚钟","author":"卢龙云","text":"寺对群峰寂，门临一径斜。\n瀑寒山向暝，烟密树交遮。\n僧饭过香积，禅栖伴法华。\n似应钟定后，趺坐说三车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19521,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潇湘八景 其三 渔村夕照","author":"卢龙云","text":"积水环门绿，斜阳隔岸红。\n捲纶初系笮，待月更推篷。\n泊处依沙柳，歌来杂暮鸿。\n得鱼供乐事，沽酒醉应同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19522,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潇湘八景 其四 远浦归帆","author":"卢龙云","text":"松径因回岸，茅斋对夕阳。\n双双翔鹳鹤，片片乱帆樯。\n候已乘风便，心宁怯路长。\n柴门当半掩，波静舣归航。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19523,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潇湘八景 其五 潇湘夜雨","author":"卢龙云","text":"近水开千亩，凌云挺万竿。\n岸容初过雨，林气迥生寒。\n植节苍逾劲，含风翠欲攒。\n夜闻清籁远，晓望更檀栾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19524,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潇湘八景 其六 平沙落雁","author":"卢龙云","text":"秋早知寒候，霜前到水涯。\n群依鸥鹭侣，声散荻芦花。\n潦尽沙痕广，江空月影斜。\n何须畏鱼网，长自狎浮槎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19525,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潇湘八景 其七 洞庭秋月","author":"卢龙云","text":"远水兼天涌，清秋入月来。\n龙宫珠乍吐，鸾镜匣初开。\n荡漾君山出，苍凉梦泽回。\n买舟堪傍此，随意宿沙隈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19526,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潇湘八景 其八 江天暮雪","author":"卢龙云","text":"浩渺波光阔，霏微野望迷。\n远看蓑笠钓，犹傍水云栖。\n岛映银涛白，林欹玉树低。\n岂无乘兴棹，一入剡山溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19527,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋初答林园相诗酒之惠二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"山林多乐事，秋入兴逾赊。\n忽枉传诗句，空惭负岁华。\n尊开泉石侣，月照水云家。\n更喜秦侯健，青门尚种瓜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19528,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋初答林园相诗酒之惠二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"年光看渐晚，秋气又生寒。\n鬓欲相催白，颜谁解驻丹。\n竹林方慕阮，诗传旧推韩。\n斗酒因君赠，羁怀酌自宽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19529,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感遇三首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"世情纷忌直，宦态转为工。\n触事情偏感，趋时愿不同。\n是非庄蝶梦，得失楚人弓。\n汝力虽难致，欣看论已公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19530,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感遇三首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"百里今司牧，俦非保障哉。\n食须怜弱肉，吹或借寒灰。\n直道凭谁主，狂澜未可回。\n逢时应百感，何止七堪哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19531,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感遇三首 其三","author":"卢龙云","text":"澹泊明吾志，孤贞谢世嚣。\n蛾眉妒任老，鸡肋毁防销。\n未拟三休去，真成独酌谣。\n自公多暇日，堪自慰蓬飘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19532,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潘季选比部以颁诏事竣还朝并携其子就试都下赋别二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"六传从天下，三山恋昼游。\n波恬看大海，风动遍遐陬。\n使节随丹凤，严程待紫骝。\n西南仍羽檄，何以借前筹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19533,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潘季选比部以颁诏事竣还朝并携其子就试都下赋别二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"赴阙春为伴，归朝吏是仙。\n署云初号白，疏草旧称玄。\n留滞吾同远，飞腾尔独先。\n秋来看羽翮，庭下更联翩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19534,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花","author":"卢龙云","text":"隙地才如掌，绯桃亦数株。\n秦源迹岂类，潘县意堪俱。\n嫩叶含风袅，飞花满径铺。\n刘郎偏有恨，竟日忆玄都。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19535,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答陈生子东","author":"卢龙云","text":"风尘淹作宦，朋旧几登仙。\n远是匡衡牒，先谁祖逖鞭。\n羊肠惊尚怯，豹尾望空悬。\n奏课知无补，深惭汉吏贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19536,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王生自闻赍平倭捷诏于莆阳有赠赋答","author":"卢龙云","text":"子虚犹未遇，乘传似南行。\n大有题桥志，兼怜结袜情。\n歌因怀杕杜，心已畀干旌。\n老幼知扶杖，瞻天百感生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19537,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邹太学筑堤防海乡人德之立石纪功为赋二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"银浪兼天远，金堤历岁成。\n回澜过砥柱，拯溺遍群生。\n沧海将相变，污邪尽可耕。\n睹河思绩茂，况已颂如京。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19538,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邹太学筑堤防海乡人德之立石纪功为赋二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"未遇占经济，家声旧度支。\n玄夷金授简，黎庶口为碑。\n下噀俱仓积，穷檐岂怨咨。\n公车他日对，堪作水衡司。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19539,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读陶集有感","author":"卢龙云","text":"彭泽归能早，柴桑遁亦嘉。\n一官辞簿领，五柳傍烟霞。\n守寂全天性，栖真谢物华。\n潇然尘?外，得句转堪誇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19540,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王百谷谓余久不调意诗为祟也赋答二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"久欲蠲诗癖，三缄渐废言。\n官閒时见猎，业在匪专门。\n五斗知何物，千秋用自存。\n惊人仍丽句，留滞不须论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19541,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王百谷谓余久不调意诗为祟也赋答二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"海内论骚雅，登坛几代兴。\n江山留汗漫，风月竞腾凌。\n工自穷应得，吟随困转增。\n诗魔宁有祟，天意或堪凭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19542,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻雁","author":"卢龙云","text":"羡尔云中雁，春深又北翔。\n如何天畔客，岁久尚南荒。\n心岂虞缯缴，谋非为稻粱。\n静观群物理，漂泊负随阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19543,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"方生志赓自三吴归索一言以寿其尊人为赋二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"游子心千里，瞻云海一方。\n春晖遥爱日，彩服待持觞。\n酒酿沧波阔，歌翻白雪长。\n倚门仍有望，健翮早飞扬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19544,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"方生志赓自三吴归索一言以寿其尊人为赋二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"旧业资青简，传家事素王。\n问奇杨子宅，通德郑公乡。\n岁月看逾远，诗书泽未央。\n冈陵何所颂，承志在明光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19545,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒食后试新茶因忆故山植茶先垄之畔间别者数年矣","author":"卢龙云","text":"何处茶山好，云腴美建溪。\n黄芽先蛰出，紫笋入春齐。\n持赠逢新火，斜封认远题。\n故园应比昔，客梦几樵西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19546,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜春四首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"客舍馀三月，尘途又一春。\n光阴频改岁，风物却愁人。\n桃李俱成实，葵榴复渐新。\n重来双语燕，如解识相亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19547,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜春四首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"几日春将尽，飞花到夏初。\n游丝萦陇树，新笋傍畦蔬。\n客久谙齐物，愁来学著书。\n云山千里外，风雨梦吾庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19548,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜春四首 其三","author":"卢龙云","text":"海畔春常早，炎蒸亦更先。\n暖风初启蛰，暑雨旋盈阡。\n物候过鶗鴂，谷声响杜鹃。\n客怀何所寄，空自惜流年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19549,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜春四首 其四","author":"卢龙云","text":"晴雨长相半，山容望转佳。\n叶齐烟漠漠，林静鸟喈喈。\n云气过亭幔，溪声入舫斋。\n伤春无限事，独坐酌茅柴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19550,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"车一中明府报绩寄赠二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"昔年三辅地，挥麈共谈天。\n一别风尘隔，相怀道路偏。\n握符分海甸，应宿耀星缠。\n喜尔书劳最，堪追汉吏贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19551,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"车一中明府报绩寄赠二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"烽火边亭密，诛求里巷繁。\n抡才资保障，别利试盘根。\n远徼听舆颂，中朝得主恩。\n飞凫将万里，留滞愧同论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19552,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日病肺二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"改岁方盈月，韶光逐望开。\n畏寒仍伏枕，听雨废传杯。\n入树莺交坐，窥檐燕未回。\n不言桃与李，朝暮为谁催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19553,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日病肺二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"节是中和候，人非卧病时。\n雨馀山转丽，寒歛树多姿。\n社赛宜春酒，池添梦草诗。\n不须传七发，强欲对花枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19554,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观刈麦","author":"卢龙云","text":"布谷声初定，欣看麦已秋。\n两岐虚颂瑞，八口但消忧。\n地薄难盈室，心劳岂植畴。\n独怜春雨足，兼可望瓯窭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19555,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新笋二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"旧干依檐出，新芽拆藓来。\n清标霜里劲，生意地中回。\n何日能栖凤，先春解友梅。\n琴囊与诗卷，还并绿阴开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19556,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新笋二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"有美凌霜操，千竿羡渭滨。\n檀栾开隙地，幽洒绝纤尘。\n山月摇光碎，溪烟染翠匀。\n频移新雨后，到处易为春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19557,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中答慰林茂才","author":"卢龙云","text":"海上多梅雨，途中滞客衣。\n雾当松径合，寒共佛灯微。\n骨肉经时别，山川几梦归。\n登楼闻作赋，怜尔谬相依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19558,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"久雨二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"燕拂山云满，龙吟壑雾宽。\n悬厓皆响瀑，入夜迥生寒。\n耕叹霖为潦，行歌路正难。\n晚当虹饮涧，倚杖隔林看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19559,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"久雨二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"望海仍为雨，看山尚出云。\n林鸠非唤妇，江鹳乱呼群。\n天地愁常暝，莺花爱晚曛。\n气蒸霞欲变，万里见晴氛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19560,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"佛日","author":"卢龙云","text":"觉路迷尘鞅，空门愧静虚。\n心应藏定慧，性自合真如。\n礼塔闻金磬，开堂响木鱼。\n宰官云可度，吾亦傍僧庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19561,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"屡丰亭看山五首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"半亩随官舍，千岩面众山。\n雨鸣溪泼泼，风递鸟关关。\n寓目何妨远，会心长自閒。\n无须烦蜡屐，选胜待跻攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19562,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"屡丰亭看山五首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"背郭连苍霭，为园护翠微。\n峰峦千叠秀，涧道百泉飞。\n花落红初歛，阴浓绿转肥。\n非关忘物累，惟觉簿书稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19563,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"屡丰亭看山五首 其三","author":"卢龙云","text":"孤亭山下出，四野坐中看。\n缥缈丹霞度，参差绿树攒。\n松闻风淅历，竹报日平安。\n扫石俱堪坐，羁愁但自宽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19564,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"屡丰亭看山五首 其四","author":"卢龙云","text":"讼简閒应得，公馀隐亦兼。\n云流随近远，山色任浓纤。\n短槛花相绕，疏林笋为添。\n尘心如涤尽，趺坐看楞严。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19565,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"屡丰亭看山五首 其五","author":"卢龙云","text":"为爱山容好，都忘吏事劳。\n捲帘青嶂入，隐几白云高。\n荒似陶潜径，幽同仲蔚蒿。\n拄颐多觉爽，飞翠落松涛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19566,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚憩园亭","author":"卢龙云","text":"闭户无人过，凭轩到日西。\n草为书带长，苔似蔓金齐。\n选地看除径，呼僮学灌畦。\n客怀偏自动，风静鹧鸪啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19567,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄答张幼于二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"吴会多才子，君家并国工。\n高谈倾稷下，独步失江东。\n赤帜谁争长，清尊未可同。\n传来新丽句，累牍羡词雄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19568,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄答张幼于二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"十载空吟越，双钩自美吴。\n文成辉五凤，价重等三都。\n下里知难和，中原几并驱。\n阊门应弭棹，看尔立操觚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19569,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与客谈西事二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"兵革年来苦，西南衅复开。\n兴师勤薄伐，授钺急渠魁。\n豕突虞穷寇，鹰扬藉异才。\n功成是何日，奏捷羽书回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19570,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与客谈西事二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"重镇新开府，孤军渐合符。\n谋臣多聚米，与国共飞刍。\n业更期安堵，悲应免向隅。\n论功谁第一，麟阁貌堪图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19571,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四明毛生为余绘雁图四幅悬之壁间令人有沧洲之想","author":"卢龙云","text":"近识四明客，浮来海上槎。\n心专毫素业，迹异博徒家。\n匠意丹青巧，游神水石嘉。\n潇湘如在目，落雁满平沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19572,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"褚邑丞以署捕有功院道交奖二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"百里分司牧，千家颂有丞。\n全牛看解刃，一鹤对凝冰。\n心为穷檐苦，名堪长吏称。\n四方今上计，于尔识廉能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19573,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"褚邑丞以署捕有功院道交奖二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"里巷倾豪举，鱼盐挟重赀。\n诘奸知胆碎，禦暴见风移。\n丹凤腾应远，黄龙兆愈奇。\n天曹徵吏绩，誉命此为基。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19574,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄家书二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"自我违松菊，风尘几不堪。\n集忧将满百，缄口未能三。\n当户谁称虎，于田或舞骖。\n骞腾迟羽翮，何日见图南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19575,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄家书二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"看云移白日，乡梦渺愁余。\n画虎书频达，屠龙技久虚。\n未须惭后乘，且自戒前车。\n末路知何似，吾将赋遂初。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19576,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马江候潮","author":"卢龙云","text":"舟楫徒能具，江湖未可行。\n转移天地力，留滞古今情。\n风漾鸥波细，潮平鹭渚生。\n中流看鼓舵，更听棹歌声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19577,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答林生于玄","author":"卢龙云","text":"海滨留渐久，汉阙望逾高。\n造士功何似，忧时念转劳。\n迁难超贾傅，贤愧颂王褒。\n他日长怀处，诗篇咏木桃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19578,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答林生君勉","author":"卢龙云","text":"分符淹远宦，化士岂文翁。\n桃李无言外，风云变态中。\n抡才需北阙，奏赋待南宫。\n海色看鹏运，扶桑晓日红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19579,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻蝉","author":"卢龙云","text":"大野腾朝旭，芳郊逗远风。\n露华知久洁，林响听初同。\n渐彻层霄外，长吟化日中。\n一枝元自足，感尔思无穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19580,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新造舟成与客同泛二首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"一苇应难渡，芳洲采木兰。\n功成堪利涉，兴在且追欢。\n鸥鹭吟边狎，云山望里宽。\n风涛长愿息，凉月趁清澜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19581,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新造舟成与客同泛二首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"往返何尝定，江行屡买舟。\n忽看浮彩鹢，试共泛清流。\n鱼鸟皆成趣，烟波未倦游。\n潇然逃暑外，倚棹对沧洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19582,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"貤恩初下感赋四首 其一","author":"卢龙云","text":"薄宦吾诚拙，君恩喜渐回。\n微劳俱不泯，先德故能培。\n锡服沾殊典，弹冠及夜台。\n九原难复作，风木转堪哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19583,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"貤恩初下感赋四首 其二","author":"卢龙云","text":"汨没风尘久，鸾书始见褒。\n岂因循绩异，庶录义方劳。\n就日尧阶远，瞻天汉阙高。\n涓埃时欲报，心逐五陵豪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19584,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"貤恩初下感赋四首 其三","author":"卢龙云","text":"往事何须问，承恩孰后先。\n幸犹烦记忆，敢自怨留连。\n岵屺怀俱积，幽明赉并宣。\n异时毕犬马，何以答尧天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19585,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"貤恩初下感赋四首 其四","author":"卢龙云","text":"椿萱成隔世，薄命久荒丘。\n菽水欢难足，糟糠愿未酬。\n存亡空有恨，俯仰不须愁。\n操作还荆布，蘋蘩尚可修。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":19586,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]